[{"id":2707993006,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6haLGu","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104456#pullrequestreview-2707993006","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104456","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-22T09:49:06Z"},{"id":4210625170,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc76-QqS","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e61c236617d6341b676f6ff6a9589fce48779a86","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"Tested this PR. The button to open the context menu is now more obviously a button, and you can right mouse click on the node to open the context menu as well. Both great improvements.\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7eddee83-d8a8-481c-9c27-4384ee16b93f\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de1424bb-23fb-4d9a-a8e3-132992749f30\r\n\r\nHowever, this PR also changes that the focussed object in the scene tree is NOT the one that is being inspected, which is a 'break of contract' that what you have selected in the scene tree or file system is what you are inspecting. \r\n\r\nBrainstorming freely, I would say that the 'show node in tree' option could _highlight_ the item in the tree as opposed to actually focus / select it. Perhaps putting a (temporary) border around the item in the scene tree, or something like that – visually distinct from the hover and selected state of items in the tree.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104456#pullrequestreview-4210625170","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104456","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-01T08:56:40Z"},{"id":4928178977,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJb4LIQ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"26f1ade79286314884347832b4034ebdebc99345","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"Tested & my above point was addressed. A few more nitpicks:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"202\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-13 at 16 26 30\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51cf7675-de7a-436c-a9df-c4d045b0df9f\" />\r\n\r\n- Having both the focussed state and the new highlight state on the same item (which you can do by being \"fast\" and clicking on the highlighted node) looks ok but maybe isn't ideal. I'd probably remove the highlight state upon focussing?\r\n- I'd love to be able to right mouse click on the 3 dotted button too, spawning the same context menu. If easy, then yes please!\r\n- Maybe a tiny bit of rounded corners on the highlight, similar to the focussed state?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104456#pullrequestreview-4928178977","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104456","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-08-13T14:28:45Z"},{"id":5042378711,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLIyX1w","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"773730db7e63bda958d27d4f8c6a2d0ae1173060","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?u=ccfc0c8ff4c980eb77e097aa72e9ad04749294a9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","login":"YeldhamDev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev"},"body":"Good to go.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104456#pullrequestreview-5042378711","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104456","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-27T15:06:46Z"}]